{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GesGeometryLibrary","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A host that wants it passes "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.gameeventscript.GameEventScriptRuntime\/documentation\/GameEventScriptRuntime\/GesGeometryLibrary\/catalog(next:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to the compiler and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.gameeventscript.GameEventScriptRuntime\/documentation\/GameEventScriptRuntime\/GesGeometryLibrary\/externalTypes(next:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.gameeventscript.GameEventScriptRuntime\/documentation\/GameEventScriptRuntime\/GesGeometryLibrary\/extensions(next:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the host, each in front of its own catalog or registry, which resolves what the library does not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":":Box(lower: p, upper: q)"},{"type":"text","text":" takes two corners in any order, which its fields "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lower"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"upper"},{"type":"text","text":" return ordered ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"min"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"max"},{"type":"text","text":" are GES keywords), and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":":Box(center: p, size: v)"},{"type":"text","text":" a centre and a size;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":":Poly(points: [...])"},{"type":"text","text":" takes its points; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":":Disc(center: p, radius: r)"},{"type":"text","text"